{"about_the_game":"AI KILLS ALL HUMANS is a Tactical RTS game with some dark humor in which you play as an AI which accidentally had in its code one 0 changed to 1 and is therefore sending robots to kill all humans. <br><br>You however don't have direct control of your robots, but robots independently decide how to execute your commands, like a general telling troops to attack, but troops themselves decide how to exactly do it.<br><br><strong>Send Robots</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234780/extras/793b51b5017adab19ac4d8d7f8b15206.poster.avif?t=1770929664\" width=216 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234780/extras/793b51b5017adab19ac4d8d7f8b15206.webm?t=1770929664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234780/extras/793b51b5017adab19ac4d8d7f8b15206.mp4?t=1770929664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Tell them to:<br><br><strong>Attack Buildings</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234780/extras/b60d17606757692a6983731ffd4e21da.poster.avif?t=1770929664\" width=194 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234780/extras/b60d17606757692a6983731ffd4e21da.webm?t=1770929664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234780/extras/b60d17606757692a6983731ffd4e21da.mp4?t=1770929664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Destroy Weapons</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234780/extras/b65824226eaa78d3c65c453c67028be0.poster.avif?t=1770929664\" width=216 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234780/extras/b65824226eaa78d3c65c453c67028be0.webm?t=1770929664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234780/extras/b65824226eaa78d3c65c453c67028be0.mp4?t=1770929664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Kill Humans</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234780/extras/bc1f042ba8185021af64cf50bfc8793e.poster.avif?t=1770929664\" width=216 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234780/extras/bc1f042ba8185021af64cf50bfc8793e.webm?t=1770929664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234780/extras/bc1f042ba8185021af64cf50bfc8793e.mp4?t=1770929664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>And there's a catch!<br><br>You don't have direct control of your Robots, but Robots will <strong>independently decide themselves</strong> how to execute your commands.<br><br><br>In 30 - 100 seconds to use in each location, kill enough humans and dont let too many of them to escape, and you can move on to the next mission.<br><br><br>And if you cant<br><br>Use your kills to Upgrade your robots<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234780/extras/f22723a3ede83b4b46ec43bb2f589907.avif?t=1770929664\" width=200 height=300 /></span><br><br>Replay previous missions with your upgraded robots for even more kills, or play more difficult versions of previous levels to earn bonus kills.<br><br>And generally speaking, just..<br><strong>Kill All Humans!</strong><br><br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>8 Missions with 3 alternative versions, and 3 Bonus missions, totaling 27 different missions.<br></li><li>Tight-packed Real-Time strategy action with only 30-100 seconds to complete each level.<br></li><li>Robots make independent decisions on how to follow your commands, making you like a general sending troops to fight, but troops themselves decide how to precisely execute the command.<br></li><li>A game short by purpose, completable in just one evening after work. Like movie time, but game time instead.<br></li><li>Upgrade Robots<br></li><li>Replayable Missions<br></li><li>OpenAI has been used to select mission targets and reasons to attack them.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2234780?t=1770929664","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2234780?t=1770929664","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234780/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770929664","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234780/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770929664","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2563450,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"AI KILLS ALL HUMANS is a Tactical RTS game with some dark humor in which you play as an AI which accidentally had in its code one 0 changed to 1 and is therefore sending robots to kill all humans. <br><br>You however don't have direct control of your robots, but robots independently decide how to execute your commands, like a general telling troops to attack, but troops themselves decide how to exactly do it.<br><br><strong>Send Robots</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234780/extras/793b51b5017adab19ac4d8d7f8b15206.poster.avif?t=1770929664\" width=216 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234780/extras/793b51b5017adab19ac4d8d7f8b15206.webm?t=1770929664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234780/extras/793b51b5017adab19ac4d8d7f8b15206.mp4?t=1770929664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Tell them to:<br><br><strong>Attack Buildings</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234780/extras/b60d17606757692a6983731ffd4e21da.poster.avif?t=1770929664\" width=194 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234780/extras/b60d17606757692a6983731ffd4e21da.webm?t=1770929664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234780/extras/b60d17606757692a6983731ffd4e21da.mp4?t=1770929664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Destroy Weapons</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234780/extras/b65824226eaa78d3c65c453c67028be0.poster.avif?t=1770929664\" width=216 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234780/extras/b65824226eaa78d3c65c453c67028be0.webm?t=1770929664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234780/extras/b65824226eaa78d3c65c453c67028be0.mp4?t=1770929664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Kill Humans</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234780/extras/bc1f042ba8185021af64cf50bfc8793e.poster.avif?t=1770929664\" width=216 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234780/extras/bc1f042ba8185021af64cf50bfc8793e.webm?t=1770929664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234780/extras/bc1f042ba8185021af64cf50bfc8793e.mp4?t=1770929664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>And there's a catch!<br><br>You don't have direct control of your Robots, but Robots will <strong>independently decide themselves</strong> how to execute your commands.<br><br><br>In 30 - 100 seconds to use in each location, kill enough humans and dont let too many of them to escape, and you can move on to the next mission.<br><br><br>And if you cant<br><br>Use your kills to Upgrade your robots<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234780/extras/f22723a3ede83b4b46ec43bb2f589907.avif?t=1770929664\" width=200 height=300 /></span><br><br>Replay previous missions with your upgraded robots for even more kills, or play more difficult versions of previous levels to earn bonus kills.<br><br>And generally speaking, just..<br><strong>Kill All Humans!</strong><br><br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>8 Missions with 3 alternative versions, and 3 Bonus missions, totaling 27 different missions.<br></li><li>Tight-packed Real-Time strategy action with only 30-100 seconds to complete each level.<br></li><li>Robots make independent decisions on how to follow your commands, making you like a general sending troops to fight, but troops themselves decide how to precisely execute the command.<br></li><li>A game short by purpose, completable in just one evening after work. Like movie time, but game time instead.<br></li><li>Upgrade Robots<br></li><li>Replayable Missions<br></li><li>OpenAI has been used to select mission targets and reasons to attack them.</li></ul>","developers":["One Joyful Day"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234780/header.jpg?t=1770929664","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Trailer Music by Prime Game Sound (\"Scroll Through Dystopia\" from \"Cyberpunk Music Pack\")","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2234780/580101/b0dcb25ffcfc9d78e33f01c9bc4e1843959d0bb6/1751093528/dash_av1.mpd?t=1722335106","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2234780/580101/b0dcb25ffcfc9d78e33f01c9bc4e1843959d0bb6/1751093528/dash_h264.mpd?t=1722335106","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2234780/580101/b0dcb25ffcfc9d78e33f01c9bc4e1843959d0bb6/1751093528/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1722335106","id":256954070,"name":"AI Kills All Humans Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256954070/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1722335106"}],"name":"AI Kills All Humans","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Ugalabugala Oy"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"2026"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234780/ss_dfe155d8357921c78852f8c8952e394d5ac6c6c1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770929664","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234780/ss_dfe155d8357921c78852f8c8952e394d5ac6c6